<% @page_title = "Privacy" %>
<h1 class="wp-heading-inline">Privacy</h1>
<hr class="wp-header-end">
<%= render "console/info/nav" %>
<p>This page describes how the console itself handles data. The console stores a single
session cookie (<code>wordpress_logged_in</code>) to keep you signed in, and records the
personal-data export and erasure requests you create under Tools. To set the public
site&#8217;s privacy policy, use <%= link_to "Settings › Privacy", "/console/settings/privacy" %>
and the <%= link_to "Privacy Policy Guide", "/console/tools/privacy-guide" %>.</p>
